# Styling Guidelines

## TailwindCSS

This project uses TailwindCSS with WeApp adapter (`weapp-tailwindcss`) for utility-first styling with automatic rpx conversion.

### Basic Usage

**Layout**:
```vue
<template>
  <!-- Flexbox -->
  <view class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
    <text>Centered</text>
  </view>
  
  <!-- Grid -->
  <view class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <view>Item 1</view>
    <view>Item 2</view>
  </view>
</template>
```

**Spacing with rpx** - Use square brackets:
```vue
<template>
  <!-- Padding & Margin -->
  <view class="p-[20rpx] px-[30rpx] m-[10rpx] mt-[20rpx]">
    Content
  </view>
  
  <!-- Width & Height -->
  <view class="w-[750rpx] h-[200rpx]">
    <text class="text-[28rpx]">Text</text>
  </view>
</template>
```

**Why rpx?**
- **CRITICAL**: In uni-app, viewport width is **always 750rpx** regardless of device
- `rpx` (responsive pixel) = uni-app's responsive unit
- uni-app automatically scales to actual device size
- **Always use rpx, never px**

**Converting from Figma/Design Files**:
- Design width 375px → multiply by 2 (100px → 200rpx)
- Design width 750px → use directly (200px → 200rpx)
- Formula: `rpx = (design_px / design_width) * 750`

```
Figma (375px wide):     Figma (750px wide):
100px → 200rpx          200px → 200rpx
14px  → 28rpx           28px  → 28rpx
10px  → 20rpx           20px  → 20rpx
```

**Colors**:
```vue
<template>
  <view class="bg-white bg-gray-100 bg-blue-500">
    <text class="text-gray-800 text-blue-500">Colored text</text>
    <view class="border border-gray-300">Border</view>
  </view>
</template>
```

**Typography**:
```vue
<template>
  <!-- Font size with rpx -->
  <text class="text-[24rpx]">Small</text>
  <text class="text-[28rpx]">Normal</text>
  <text class="text-[32rpx]">Large</text>
  
  <!-- Or use default sizes -->
  <text class="text-sm text-base text-lg text-xl">Text</text>
  
  <!-- Font weight & alignment -->
  <text class="font-normal font-medium font-bold">Bold</text>
  <text class="text-left text-center text-right">Aligned</text>
</template>
```

**Borders & Rounded**:
```vue
<template>
  <view class="rounded rounded-lg rounded-full">
    <image class="w-[100rpx] h-[100rpx] rounded-full" src="avatar.jpg" />
  </view>
  
  <view class="border border-2 border-gray-300">
    Bordered
  </view>
</template>
```

**Shadows**:
```vue
<template>
  <view class="shadow shadow-md shadow-lg">
    Card with shadow
  </view>
</template>
```

### Responsive Design

**Breakpoints**:
```vue
<template>
  <view class="w-full sm:w-1/2 md:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4">
    Responsive width
  </view>
  
  <text class="text-[24rpx] sm:text-[28rpx] md:text-[32rpx]">
    Responsive text
  </text>
  
  <!-- Hide/show -->
  <view class="hidden sm:block">Visible on small+</view>
  <view class="block sm:hidden">Mobile only</view>
</template>
```

Default breakpoints: `sm: 640px`, `md: 768px`, `lg: 1024px`, `xl: 1280px`

